<title>UK: TENNIS-NOTTINGHAM OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-NOTTINGHAM OPEN SECOND ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>NOTTINGHAM, England 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Second round results</p>
<p>at the Nottingham Open men's tennis tournament on Wednesday</p>
<p>(prefix denotes seed):</p>
<p>Karol Kucera (Slovakia) beat Byron Black (Zimbabwe) 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Scott Draper (Australia) beat Adrian Voinea (Romania) 6-3 2-6</p>
<p>7-6 (7-3)</p>
<p>Jason Stoltenberg (Australia) beat 6-Jim Courier (U.S.) 4-6 6-3</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>Grant Stafford (South Africa) beat 5-Jan Siemerink</p>
<p>(Netherlands) 5-7 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Sandon Stolle (Australia) beat Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark) 6-4</p>
<p>7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>4-Tim Henman (Britain) beat Richard Fromberg (Australia) 6-4 6-7 (6-8) 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>8-Alex O'Brien (U.S.) beat Marc-Kevin Goellner (Germany) 7-6 (7-4) 6-3  </p>
<p>Greg Rusedski (Britain) beat Mark Woodforde (Australia) 6-4 7-6 (8-6)</p>
</text>
